{
  "declaredLength": 6892,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Que faisons-nous dans un endroit pareil... ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006500200066006100690073006F006E0073002D006E006F00750073002000640061006E007300200075006E00200065006E00640072006F00690074002000700061007200650069006C002E002E002E0020003F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bah, j’crois que c’est ça, Extra Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200610068002C0020006A201900630072006F006900730020007100750065002000632019006500730074002000E70061002C00200045007800740072006100200049006C006C0075006D006900730020002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon intuition me dit que moi aussi, je suis née\ndu subconscient d’un individu...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous deux ! La Néo Team Flare !\nJ’ai une question importante à vous poser...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais avant ça, faisons un combat ! Si je gagne,\nvous me promettez de répondre à ma question !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 178
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! Tu acceptes de me prêter\nmain-forte ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002000210020005400750020006100630063006500700074006500730020006400650020006D006500200070007200EA007400650072000A006D00610069006E002D0066006F0072007400650020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entendu !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00740065006E00640075002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends une seconde.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E0064007300200075006E00650020007300650063006F006E00640065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu comptes étudier la situation pour mettre en\nplace une stratégie ? Je vois ! C’est futé !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avec toi, la victoire est assurée !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100760065006300200074006F0069002C0020006C006100200076006900630074006F006900720065002000650073007400200061007300730075007200E900650020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’en veux encore d’avoir été choisi<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe par\nZygarde à ma place...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAccepte de te battre pour me permettre d’oublier\ncette frustration.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, j’veux bien qu’on se batte, mais si tu perds,\ntu viens faire la plonge au café !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous allons gagner !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0075007300200061006C006C006F006E00730020006700610067006E00650072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’en ai pas envie...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E20190065006E002000610069002000700061007300200065006E007600690065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce n’est pas le moment de te défiler...\nJe brûle d’impatience de me battre contre toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dracaufeu ! Embrase nos adversaires avec\nton souffle noir !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044007200610063006100750066006500750020002100200045006D006200720061007300650020006E006F007300200061006400760065007200730061006900720065007300200061007600650063000A0074006F006E00200073006F007500660066006C00650020006E006F006900720020002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et de quoi t’as envie, au juste ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450074002000640065002000710075006F00690020007420190061007300200065006E007600690065002C0020006100750020006A00750073007400650020003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’vais vous réduire en cendres !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019007600610069007300200076006F007500730020007200E90064007500690072006500200065006E002000630065006E0064007200650073002000210021002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je veux savoir quel était le rôle de mon mentor\nquand il était dans la Team Flare !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dracaufeu, méga-évolue ! Brille de mille feux\net brûle tout sur ton passage !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette Méga-Évolution, c’est le « Néo » de notre\nnom ! Le symbole de notre renouveau !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voici la force du lien qui m’unit à mon Pokémon !\nEn hommage à mes deux mentors !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maintenant que le combat est terminé,\nvous allez honorer votre promesse.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien entendu.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E00200065006E00740065006E00640075002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je veux savoir ce que faisait Xanthin,\nmon mentor, au sein de la Team Flare.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il cherchait à savoir s’il était possible de renforcer\nl’être humain comme la Méga-Évolution permet<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde renforcer les Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSes recherches lui ont permis de mettre au point\nla Combinaison Booster.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 209
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous devions lui servir de sujets d’expérience,\nmais pour une raison que j’ignore, il t’a choisie.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est tout c’qu’on sait. On était pas vraiment\nproches de Xanthin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200074006F00750074002000632019007100752019006F006E00200073006100690074002E0020004F006E002000E90074006100690074002000700061007300200076007200610069006D0065006E0074000A00700072006F0063006800650073002000640065002000580061006E007400680069006E002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il était très gentil avec moi... C’est pour ça que\nje voulais en savoir un peu plus sur lui.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il était entièrement dévoué à ses recherches,\nmais tu avais aussi une place dans son cœur.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les êtres humains, c’est plein d’contradictions.\nT’es pas d’accord ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650073002000EA0074007200650073002000680075006D00610069006E0073002C00200063201900650073007400200070006C00650069006E0020006420190063006F006E00740072006100640069006300740069006F006E0073002E000A00542019006500730020007000610073002000642019006100630063006F007200640020003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il restera le même dans son souvenir.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C002000720065007300740065007200610020006C00650020006D00EA006D0065002000640061006E007300200073006F006E00200073006F007500760065006E00690072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La gentillesse de Xanthin était réelle.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000670065006E00740069006C006C0065007300730065002000640065002000580061006E007400680069006E002000E900740061006900740020007200E90065006C006C0065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci... C’est sympa de me soutenir.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002E002E002E002000432019006500730074002000730079006D007000610020006400650020006D006500200073006F007500740065006E00690072002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tiens, tu as bien mérité cette récompense.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTu m’as en quelque sorte ouvert les yeux sur\nla raison pour laquelle Zygarde ne m’a pas choisi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous obtenez la veste de barista de Cendro !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006F006200740065006E0065007A0020006C006100200076006500730074006500200064006500200062006100720069007300740061002000640065002000430065006E00640072006F002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parfait ! Comme ça, si tu t’décides à venir faire\nla plonge au café, t’auras déjà la tenue !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je doute fort que cela arrive.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> est bien trop occupé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à venir\nen aide aux Pokémon et à la population.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous ne pouvons nous permettre de l’obliger à\nfaire la plonge.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nQuoi qu’il en soit, n’hésite pas à passer au café\nsi tu as besoin d’aide.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Illumis est imprégnée des expériences de vie\nen tous genres de ses habitants et des Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "N’empêche, elle est bien fade cette Extra Illumis.\nJ’me demande bien qui a imaginé un tel endroit...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’adore mon métier de détective, car il me permet\nde découvrir plein de facettes de la ville !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    }
  ],
